---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::top()"
---
deft 0.1.0 - local file toolkit. Usage: deft <group> <command> [inputs] [-o output]

Groups:
  pdf      Merge, split, compress, encrypt, forms, OCR, compare, convert
  image    Resize, crop, convert, compress, adjust, montage, OCR
  doc      Word/ODT/RTF: to text, Markdown, HTML, PDF; find and replace
  slides   PowerPoint: extract text, Markdown outline
  sheet    Excel/CSV/ODS tables: pivot, merge, split, convert
  json     JSON: convert, validate against a schema
  toml     TOML: convert, format, merge, diff, validate
  xml      XML: convert to JSON, YAML or TOML
  yaml     YAML: convert, merge, diff, validate
  md       Markdown to PDF, HTML, Word, EPUB; table of contents
  html     HTML to Markdown, text, Word and PDF
  epub     E-books: info, to text, Markdown and PDF
  gps      GPX and KML tracks: convert, distance and time
  qr       Create QR codes and barcodes; read QR codes

Any file:
  convert  <in>... -o <out>   Any-to-any by extension, e.g. deft convert a.png -o a.pdf
  info     <file>...          Type, size, pages, dimensions, duration
  find     <words>            Search commands by intent

Next: deft <group> | deft <group> <command> --help | deft help common
Other: schema, engine, skill, doctor. Results are one line; add --json for structure.
